Irregular triangle read by rows: n-th row gives the order of all undirected (also called weakly connected) components of the Collatz digraph of order n, sorted from largest to smallest.

The 84 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

